      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>A&nbsp;<strong>puzzle/strategy</strong>&nbsp;game&nbsp;in&nbsp;which&nbsp;you&nbsp;hack&nbsp;into&nbsp;automated&nbsp;vehicles&nbsp;to&nbsp;take&nbsp;control/steal/disrupt/sabotage.&nbsp;As&nbsp;the&nbsp;game&nbsp;progresses&nbsp;you&nbsp;must&nbsp;work&nbsp;with&nbsp;more&nbsp;and&nbsp;more&nbsp;complex&nbsp;systems,&nbsp;while&nbsp;managing&nbsp;the&nbsp;cascading&nbsp;consequences&nbsp;of&nbsp;your&nbsp;previous&nbsp;missions.&nbsp;The&nbsp;question&nbsp;lingers:&nbsp;are&nbsp;you&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;right&nbsp;side?</p>",
      "video_source": null
    },
