      "after_image": null,
      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>After&nbsp;some&nbsp;brainstrorming,&nbsp;I&nbsp;got&nbsp;captivated&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;idea&nbsp;of&nbsp;working&nbsp;with&nbsp;<strong><em>paths&nbsp;</em></strong>and&nbsp;<strong><em>light</em></strong>.&nbsp;At&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;time,&nbsp;I&nbsp;imagined&nbsp;my&nbsp;main&nbsp;character&nbsp;being&nbsp;an&nbsp;LED&nbsp;trying&nbsp;to&nbsp;make&nbsp;their&nbsp;way&nbsp;through&nbsp;tech&nbsp;circuits.&nbsp;Many&nbsp;cables&nbsp;and&nbsp;chip&nbsp;components&nbsp;create&nbsp;a&nbsp;vast&nbsp;city&nbsp;in&nbsp;which&nbsp;the&nbsp;LED&nbsp;has&nbsp;to&nbsp;solve&nbsp;puzzles&nbsp;and&nbsp;explore&nbsp;to&nbsp;progress&nbsp;in&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>3D&nbsp;environment</strong>.</p>",
      "video_source": null
    },
