      "after_image": null,
      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>After&nbsp;the&nbsp;first&nbsp;art&nbsp;tests,&nbsp;I&nbsp;wasn&#39;t&nbsp;convinced&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;direction&nbsp;the&nbsp;project&nbsp;was&nbsp;heading&nbsp;to.&nbsp;I&nbsp;could&nbsp;not&nbsp;see&nbsp;that&nbsp;well&nbsp;the&nbsp;<em>paths&nbsp;</em>I&nbsp;wanted&nbsp;to&nbsp;play&nbsp;with&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;light&nbsp;was&nbsp;just&nbsp;used&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;landmark&nbsp;to&nbsp;guide&nbsp;the&nbsp;player.&nbsp;Thus,&nbsp;I&nbsp;decided&nbsp;to&nbsp;change&nbsp;the&nbsp;a&nbsp;bit&nbsp;the&nbsp;perspective&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;game.&nbsp;Taking&nbsp;<em>Monument&nbsp;Valley</em>&nbsp;as&nbsp;an&nbsp;inspiration,&nbsp;I&nbsp;shifted&nbsp;to&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>puzzle&nbsp;mobile&nbsp;game</strong>&nbsp;in&nbsp;which&nbsp;the&nbsp;LED&nbsp;needs&nbsp;to&nbsp;move&nbsp;and&nbsp;hack&nbsp;component&nbsp;to&nbsp;reveal&nbsp;a&nbsp;path&nbsp;of&nbsp;light&nbsp;that&nbsp;lets&nbsp;it&nbsp;progress.</p>",
      "video_source": null
