      "after_image": null,
      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>The&nbsp;game&nbsp;logo&nbsp;also&nbsp;had&nbsp;several&nbsp;iterations&nbsp;until&nbsp;I&nbsp;was&nbsp;satisfied&nbsp;with&nbsp;an&nbsp;option&nbsp;that&nbsp;represented&nbsp;the&nbsp;game.&nbsp;In&nbsp;the&nbsp;final&nbsp;version,&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;clearly&nbsp;see&nbsp;the&nbsp;name&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;game&nbsp;lighted&nbsp;up,&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;the&nbsp;path&nbsp;that&nbsp;guides&nbsp;the&nbsp;player&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;game.&nbsp;Plus,&nbsp;the&nbsp;orange&nbsp;light,&nbsp;which&nbsp;acts&nbsp;as&nbsp;feedback&nbsp;of&nbsp;components&nbsp;being&nbsp;hacked&nbsp;correctly.&nbsp;Lastly,&nbsp;the&nbsp;path&nbsp;created&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;light&nbsp;forms&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>reversed&nbsp;question&nbsp;mark</strong>,&nbsp;creating&nbsp;some&nbsp;intrigue&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;player&nbsp;to&nbsp;discover&nbsp;what&nbsp;lies&nbsp;ahead.&nbsp;</p>",
