      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>Although&nbsp;it&nbsp;was&nbsp;conceived&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;mobile&nbsp;game,&nbsp;we&nbsp;were&nbsp;tasked&nbsp;to&nbsp;create&nbsp;key&nbsp;art&nbsp;for&nbsp;Steam&nbsp;and&nbsp;Nintengo&nbsp;Switch.&nbsp;For&nbsp;Steam,&nbsp;I&nbsp;decided&nbsp;to&nbsp;use&nbsp;the&nbsp;previous&nbsp;3D&nbsp;environment&nbsp;as&nbsp;I&nbsp;believed&nbsp;it&nbsp;to&nbsp;be&nbsp;more&nbsp;attractive&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;audience.&nbsp;For&nbsp;Nintendo&nbsp;Switch,&nbsp;I&nbsp;went&nbsp;for&nbsp;something&nbsp;simple&nbsp;and&nbsp;intriguing.</p>",
