      "show_in_quick_glance": true,
      "text": "<p>The&nbsp;last&nbsp;exercise&nbsp;of&nbsp;this&nbsp;project&nbsp;was&nbsp;to&nbsp;art&nbsp;direct&nbsp;a&nbsp;classmate&nbsp;to&nbsp;create&nbsp;more&nbsp;screenshots/levels&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;game.&nbsp;For&nbsp;that,&nbsp;I&nbsp;created&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong>moodboard&nbsp;</strong>with&nbsp;key&nbsp;concepts,&nbsp;color&nbsp;palettes&nbsp;and&nbsp;references.&nbsp;Lastly,&nbsp;I&nbsp;quickly&nbsp;sketched&nbsp;the&nbsp;two&nbsp;levels&nbsp;and&nbsp;sent&nbsp;it&nbsp;for&nbsp;him&nbsp;to&nbsp;create&nbsp;the&nbsp;new&nbsp;images.</p>",
