  "title": "This Land of Ours",
  "screenshots": [],
  "contributions": "<p>This&nbsp;project&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;result&nbsp;of&nbsp;an&nbsp;Art&nbsp;Direction&nbsp;workshop&nbsp;lead&nbsp;by&nbsp;<a href=\"https://zerbamine.nl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Erwin&nbsp;Kho</a>,&nbsp;art&nbsp;director&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;award-winning&nbsp;game&nbsp;Cocoon.&nbsp;Our&nbsp;goal&nbsp;was&nbsp;to&nbsp;create&nbsp;an&nbsp;<strong>identity&nbsp;</strong>for&nbsp;a&nbsp;fictional&nbsp;game&nbsp;and&nbsp;develop&nbsp;<strong>key&nbsp;art</strong>&nbsp;for&nbsp;it&nbsp;starting&nbsp;with&nbsp;nothing&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;the&nbsp;game&#39;s&nbsp;premise.</p>",
